sequenceDiagram
    participant API as Domain Transaction
    participant DB as MongoDB
    participant D as Outbox Poller
    participant B as Authorized Browser
    API->>DB: Team/membership + audit + outbox writes
    DB-->>API: Commit success
    D->>DB: Poll events after cursor
    DB-->>D: Committed minimal event
    D-->>B: SSE event: team.updated
    B->>B: Invalidate TanStack Query cache
    B->>API: GET authoritative team/board
    API-->>B: Updated state
    Note over B,API: On reconnect or visibility change, refetch even if event missed.
